Subject: gpu managed launch receipts and bounded renderer capability probing
Why: AC-T7.4.1: the node launches the VM through Shards' managed API and reads its launch receipts and a bounded renderer capability probe; the context whitelist keeps its complete native GPU correspondence; managed helpers stay in their native scope, renderer queries dispatched before them. Shards commits 62f113e7, 6b1449f3, 6f069afe and 28b4b4fd (the chain to 0ce5fbcd).

